
  Trust this clone?

  /the/clone

  kit runs nothing a clone names until you trust it. Trusting this one lets kit:
  • run bin/ci for kit gate (gate)
  • run shellcheck --shell=bash for kit lint (lint: in .kit/rules/bash.md)

  You accept code from whoever can push to it. kit does not check each pull;
  review and signed commits do. It asks again when a pull changes what the clone
  asks it to run.

